---
import Section from '../../layout/Section.astro';
---

<Section contained={false} spacing="none" class="relative py-20 lg:py-28">
            <div class="garna-container">
                <div class="reveal mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
                    <h2 class="lg:text-5xl text-4xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight font-manrope mb-6" data-translate="platform.title">
                        Everything You Need to Manage Small Business Payroll
                    </h2>
                    <p data-garna-subtitle class="leading-relaxed text-xl font-light text-gray-400 font-manrope" data-translate="platform.description">
                        We have separated the important processes to make it easier for you to manage both full-time employees and freelancers
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="platform-card-grid mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
                    <article class="platform-card reveal glass-card rounded-2xl border-[#5EA500]/15 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_16%_0%,rgba(94,165,0,0.12),transparent_34%)] p-6 md:p-8" style="--delay: 80ms">
                        <div class="mb-7 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-[#5EA500]/20 bg-[#5EA500]/10 text-[#5EA500]">
                            <iconify-icon icon="solar:user-id-linear" width="26" height="26"></iconify-icon>
                        </div>
                        <div data-platform-heading-group>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-7 text-[#5EA500] font-manrope" data-translate="platform.eor.label">1. Hire and pay employees (EoR)</h3>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-lg font-light leading-7 text-gray-300 font-manrope" data-translate="platform.eor.title">
                                Full-time recruitment without opening legal entities and hiring legal and accounting consultants abroad
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="mt-7 grid gap-3 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-300 lg:grid-rows-3">
                            <li class="flex w-full items-center rounded-xl border border-[#5EA500]/15 bg-[#5EA500]/[0.035] p-3.5 lg:min-h-[7.25rem]" data-platform-feature-row="1">
                                <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                                    <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#5EA500]/10 text-[#5EA500]">
                                        <iconify-icon icon="solar:check-circle-bold" width="14" height="14"></iconify-icon>
                                    </span>
                                    <span><strong class="block text-white" data-translate="platform.eor.feature1.title">Employer of Record</strong> <span data-translate="platform.eor.feature1.description">We become the official employer for your employees in 150+ countries.</span></span>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex w-full items-center rounded-xl border border-[#5EA500]/15 bg-[#5EA500]/[0.035] p-3.5 lg:min-h-[7.25rem]" data-platform-feature-row="2">
                                <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                                    <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#5EA500]/10 text-[#5EA500]">
                                        <iconify-icon icon="solar:check-circle-bold" width="14" height="14"></iconify-icon>
                                    </span>
                                    <span><strong class="block text-white" data-translate="platform.eor.feature2.title">Taxes and benefits</strong> <span data-translate="platform.eor.feature2.description">We take care of the calculation of contributions, health insurance and pension contributions according to local laws.</span></span>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex w-full items-center rounded-xl border border-[#5EA500]/15 bg-[#5EA500]/[0.035] p-3.5 lg:min-h-[7.25rem]" data-platform-feature-row="3">
                                <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                                    <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#5EA500]/10 text-[#5EA500]">
                                        <iconify-icon icon="solar:check-circle-bold" width="14" height="14"></iconify-icon>
                                    </span>
                                    <span><strong class="block text-white" data-translate="platform.eor.feature3.title">100% Compliance</strong> <span data-translate="platform.eor.feature3.description">All employment contracts and reports are executed flawlessly and are available to you at any time.</span></span>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </article>

                    <article class="platform-card reveal glass-card rounded-2xl border-[#6BAED6]/15 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_16%_0%,rgba(107,174,214,0.12),transparent_34%)] p-6 md:p-8" style="--delay: 160ms">
                        <div class="mb-7 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-[#6BAED6]/20 bg-[#6BAED6]/10 text-[#6BAED6]">
                            <iconify-icon icon="solar:wallet-money-linear" width="26" height="26"></iconify-icon>
                        </div>
                        <div data-platform-heading-group>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-7 text-[#6BAED6] font-manrope" data-translate="platform.cor.label">2. Pay contractors and freelancers (CoR)</h3>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-lg font-light leading-7 text-gray-300 font-manrope" data-translate="platform.cor.title">
                                Scale payments to team members in one click wherever they are
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="mt-7 grid gap-3 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-300 lg:grid-rows-3">
                            <li class="flex w-full items-center rounded-xl border border-[#6BAED6]/15 bg-[#6BAED6]/[0.035] p-3.5 lg:min-h-[7.25rem]" data-platform-feature-row="1">
                                <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                                    <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#6BAED6]/10 text-[#6BAED6]">
                                        <iconify-icon icon="solar:check-circle-bold" width="14" height="14"></iconify-icon>
                                    </span>
                                    <span><strong class="block text-white" data-translate="platform.cor.feature1.title">Flexible payments</strong> <span data-translate="platform.cor.feature1.description">Pay via SWIFT, SEPA or in the crypto. Your performers can receive money in a convenient way.</span></span>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex w-full items-center rounded-xl border border-[#6BAED6]/15 bg-[#6BAED6]/[0.035] p-3.5 lg:min-h-[7.25rem]" data-platform-feature-row="2">
                                <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                                    <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#6BAED6]/10 text-[#6BAED6]">
                                        <iconify-icon icon="solar:check-circle-bold" width="14" height="14"></iconify-icon>
                                    </span>
                                    <span><strong class="block text-white" data-translate="platform.cor.feature2.title">Auto-invoicing</strong> <span data-translate="platform.cor.feature2.description">No more billing. The system generates invoices automatically.</span></span>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex w-full items-center rounded-xl border border-[#6BAED6]/15 bg-[#6BAED6]/[0.035] p-3.5 lg:min-h-[7.25rem]" data-platform-feature-row="3">
                                <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                                    <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#6BAED6]/10 text-[#6BAED6]">
                                        <iconify-icon icon="solar:check-circle-bold" width="14" height="14"></iconify-icon>
                                    </span>
                                    <span><strong class="block text-white" data-translate="platform.cor.feature3.title">IP protection</strong> <span data-translate="platform.cor.feature3.description">Automatic transfer of intellectual property rights to you with each payment.</span></span>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </Section>
